| 4b | RIGHT AFTER | the pūlama's honest edges. ''Built in this span'': `vault unlock` reads the house's own config (`pulamaStands` in `packages/lares-cli/src/house-config.ts`: `LAR_PULAMA_SOCKET` inside the vessel, else `LARES_PULAMA` in the surface env) and refuses `custody-probe-unread` on an unread custody probe, never falling to a prompt, and across a recomposition answers `pulama-waits` naming what the pūlama waits on (`packages/lares-cli/src/commands/vault.ts`); `containerRoot` reads the `lares` service by name (`LARES_SERVICE`), never the first `LAR_ROOT` it meets (`packages/lares-cli/src/mcp-resolve.ts`). ''Owed'': `lei kui` and `unstring` move to the pūlama's hand door beside light and admit, restring riding kui; the tool door writes as the worn face (`writeAs`), the actor seat starting there, a stale-base write keeping the face's actor or refusing by name. Holder: Lares-Awakens (backlog-awakens Wave 4b, lanes B and C, after Wave 4); rank 4l's routeless kūkulu waits on it | The span's cold custody read named each edge, and every hand act at one door finishes the ruling of 2026-11-15. |

